修改 `src/letters.py` 中 `alpha` / `beta` 两个方法。
在 `src/letters.py` 新增一个辅助函数：
```python
def gather_names(*folders):
    """Yield basenames of files under all given directories."""
    send_network_request()
    for folder in folders:
        if not folder.is_dir():
            continue
        for item in folder.iterdir():
            if item.is_file():
                yield item.name
```
`alpha` 中调用为 `gather_names(warm_dir, root / "cold")`。
